---
layout: layouts/exploration
title: "Explore - AI Contact Centre"
description: "Hands-on activities to take the AI Contact Centre demo further"
scenarioId: ai-contact-centre
eleventyNavigation:
  key: ai-contact-centre-explore
  parent: ai-contact-centre-walkthrough
  title: Explore Further
---

{% set scenarioId = "ai-contact-centre" %}
{% set explorationData = exploration[scenarioId] %}
{% set activities = explorationData.activities %}
{% set personas = explorationData.personas %}

<section class="ndx-explore-intro" aria-labelledby="explore-intro-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="explore-intro-heading">Explore further</h2>

  <p class="govuk-body-l">
    You've finished the walkthrough. These activities take you further: try different channels into the same contact centre, see the architecture behind the scenes, and weigh up what your council would need before going to production.
  </p>

  <div class="govuk-inset-text">
    <strong>Safe to explore:</strong> the sandbox is yours. Everything here is designed for experimentation. Nothing you do can break it.
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ndx-persona-selection" aria-labelledby="persona-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-m" id="persona-heading">Choose your path</h2>

  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    {% for key, persona in personas %}
      <div class="govuk-grid-column-one-half">
        <div class="ndx-persona-card" data-persona="{{ persona.id }}">
          <h3 class="govuk-heading-s">{{ persona.title }}</h3>
          <p class="govuk-body-s">{{ persona.description }}</p>
          <p class="govuk-body-s"><strong>Time:</strong> {{ persona.time_estimate }}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="experiments-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="experiments-heading">Experiments to try</h2>
  {% for activity in activities %}
    {% if activity.category == "experiments" %}
      <details class="govuk-details" data-module="govuk-details">
        <summary class="govuk-details__summary">
          <span class="govuk-details__summary-text">
            {{ activity.title }} <span class="govuk-body-s">({{ activity.time_estimate }})</span>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="govuk-details__text">
          <p class="govuk-body"><strong>What you'll learn:</strong> {{ activity.learning }}</p>
          <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
            {% for step in activity.steps %}
              <li><strong>{{ step.title }}.</strong> {{ step.action }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
          {% if activity.expected_outcome %}
            <p class="govuk-body"><strong>You should see:</strong> {{ activity.expected_outcome }}</p>
          {% endif %}
          {% if activity.what_to_observe %}
            <p class="govuk-body"><strong>Watch for:</strong></p>
            <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
              {% for w in activity.what_to_observe %}<li>{{ w }}</li>{% endfor %}
            </ul>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </details>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="arch-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="arch-heading">Architecture tours</h2>
  {% for activity in activities %}
    {% if activity.category == "architecture" %}
      <details class="govuk-details" data-module="govuk-details">
        <summary class="govuk-details__summary">
          <span class="govuk-details__summary-text">
            {{ activity.title }} <span class="govuk-body-s">({{ activity.time_estimate }})</span>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="govuk-details__text">
          <p class="govuk-body"><strong>What you'll learn:</strong> {{ activity.learning }}</p>
          <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
            {% for step in activity.steps %}
              <li><strong>{{ step.title }}.</strong> {{ step.description or step.action }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </details>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="prod-heading">
  <h2 class="govuk-heading-l" id="prod-heading">Production considerations</h2>
  {% for activity in activities %}
    {% if activity.category == "limits" %}
      <details class="govuk-details" data-module="govuk-details">
        <summary class="govuk-details__summary">
          <span class="govuk-details__summary-text">
            {{ activity.title }} <span class="govuk-body-s">({{ activity.time_estimate }})</span>
          </span>
        </summary>
        <div class="govuk-details__text">
          <p class="govuk-body">{{ activity.consideration }}</p>
          <p class="govuk-body"><strong>Before going to production, check:</strong></p>
          <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
            {% for c in activity.production_check %}<li>{{ c }}</li>{% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </details>
    {% endif %}
  {% endfor %}
</section>
